Subject: [PATCH 1/4] feat(agent-core): bind invocation context to actual tool
 executors

Introduce executor-bound invocation contexts and optional scope runners.
Dispatch before forwarding and restore legacy state per invocation.
Keep owner validity and concurrent/reused-ID tests with the contract.

Retained evidence: SDK scoped 172 tests plus one independent public
session-generation probe passed on the final candidate. No new campaign
or execution of this intermediate repository snapshot is claimed.
GP global remains RED; consultation causality remains UNKNOWN.
No host activation, publication, global install or P01 operation.

Risk: items 2 and 4 (authorization and invocation/concurrency isolation).
